# Entur (Ruter sanntid)

Open APIs only. Identify every request with `ET-Client-Name` (`homey-dashboard-entre`). No OAuth.

When implementing or changing the Entre departure board, fetch docs first:

- Index: https://developer.entur.no/llms.txt
- Board: https://developer.entur.no/docs/open-services/journey-planner.md
- Examples: https://developer.entur.no/docs/open-services/journey-planner/examples.md
- GraphQL: `POST https://api.entur.io/journey-planner/v3/graphql`

Do not call Entur from the browser. Proxy + short cache via Express, same pattern as weather.

Westbound only (same as current `mon.ruter.no` iframe):

| Stop | StopPlace | Quay | Mode | Hide |
| ---- | --------- | ---- | ---- | ---- |
| Alna tog | `NSR:StopPlace:62308` | `NSR:Quay:641` | rail | Lillestrøm, bus |
| Risløkka | `NSR:StopPlace:5922` | `NSR:Quay:10861` | metro | Vestli |

3 departures per stop. Poll HTTP; no WebSocket. Use `estimatedCalls` (`expectedDepartureTime`, `aimedDepartureTime`, `realtime`, `destinationDisplay`, `line.publicCode`, `transportMode`, `situations`).

Entre kiosk is a 13.1" touch screen at **1920×1080** (`min-width: 1900px` CSS). Stue kiosk is the official Pi 7" touch v1 at **800×480** and does not show this board.

Do not keep situation text on screen. Show an amber `!` on rows that have `situations`; tap opens a popover. This is a touch kiosk — do not rely on hover.
